      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/21/princess-of-wales-impact-cancer-diagnosis-bbc-film-heal",
      "description": "<p>Documentary records Catherine taking on Three Peaks challenge and finding ‘sense of hope alongside uncertainty’</p><p>The Princess of Wales has spoken candidly about the impact of her cancer diagnosis in a BBC documentary to be aired later this month.</p><p>“Cancer does change you,” Catherine, 44, says in the trailer for the 30-minute programme. “It changes your body. It changes you physically, but there’s a much, much deeper part to what a cancer diagnosis shifts in you.”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2026/nov/21/princess-of-wales-impact-cancer-diagnosis-bbc-film-heal\">Continue reading...</a>",
